# Timing diagram for pre-edge and post-edge settle

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  A[pre-edge settle] --> B[clk.advance()]
  B --> C[post-edge settle]

  A1[poll pass 1] --> A2[poll pass 2] --> A3[fixed point]
  C1[poll pass 1] --> C2[poll pass 2] --> C3[fixed point]

  A -.-> A1
  A -.-> A2
  A -.-> A3
  C -.-> C1
  C -.-> C2
  C -.-> C3
```
